9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"XJE53HYQbXlT5vhyVDBoxw","review_id":"0ZzDpYpvXwxJfCgBpWzWKg","date":"2021-11-29T18:35:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9362833499908447,"text_excerpt":"We heard that the owner of Gris Gris had opened a new place, and we came in for some Sunday brunch - what an amazing spot! This place is now on the list of top brunch destinations in Nola, and that's some stiff competition. We sat at the bar and had some fantastic drinks (they have Bloody Mary and Mimosa specials during brunch, too, if that's your thing). We ordered way too much food, as always, but we love some Monday leftovers. To start, we had the Hoppin' John oyster salad, which has some of the tastiest fried oysters ever. Not a lot of greens, but a great salad nonetheless. We also got the turkey neck (more for my wife than me, but it is tasty), and some gumbo. The gumbo is now one of..."},{"business_id":"XJE53HYQbXlT5vhyVDBoxw","review_id":"ZGTT1ffaDpFnD99Ueo4IPw","date":"2021-12-05T16:29:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9125784039497375,"text_excerpt":"OMG - this was hands down one of the best meals I have had!!! From the craft cocktails to the savory and fresh sauces every bite and sip was amazing. The freshness of the seafood is expected in New Orleans, and St Johns did not disappoint. The individual dishes were perfect unto themselves - but the flavors were unique and you wanted to lick your plate so as not to miss any! Our server Rhett and assistant server Sheldon were wonderful. They had recommendations and were full of knowledge and served us with ease, almost as if we were in their home! You MUST make a point of making a reservation and trying St Johns!!!"},{"business_id":"XJE53HYQbXlT5vhyVDBoxw","review_id":"lZ663ojguq9L7HKSZfDOZQ","date":"2022-01-10T21:22:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9030069708824158,"text_excerpt":"Saint John is a new restaurant which has bravely opened up during the slow times of the ongoing pandemic. For my first visit I went with a group of friends and we all enjoyed our food and experience. They have a first floor that includes a chef table space and then a second floor with a great balcony overlooking Decatur Street. The big food winner here was on their appetizer menu with their \"Oysters Saint John\" which is oysters served three ways with a selection of oysters poached in double cream then crispy fried oysters and finally oyster dressing in vol-au-vent (a pastry shell). Our server informed us that the Oysters Saint John has been their most popular dish and some regulars simply..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"XJE53HYQbXlT5vhyVDBoxw","photo_id":"k8KzOIdWe93YI7Pv75Z-lQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/k8KzOIdWe93YI7Pv75Z-lQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8840346336364746},{"business_id":"XJE53HYQbXlT5vhyVDBoxw","photo_id":"U_YD9zqUJRYjaflPoT6Grg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/U_YD9zqUJRYjaflPoT6Grg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8533114790916443},{"business_id":"XJE53HYQbXlT5vhyVDBoxw","photo_id":"Z8FP4VzogDrtpL2ppJBRRA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Z8FP4VzogDrtpL2ppJBRRA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8333262205123901},{"business_id":"XJE53HYQbXlT5vhyVDBoxw","photo_id":"JKP-2olzgEjYSphyZ1bTIg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JKP-2olzgEjYSphyZ1bTIg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8298140168190002},{"business_id":"XJE53HYQbXlT5vhyVDBoxw","photo_id":"0ycjCLCQ9yd5G8Z0nt4JFQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/0ycjCLCQ9yd5G8Z0nt4JFQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8283753395080566}]},"notebook_case":null}
